              "name": "RpmMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-119374 high vulnerability for sqlite-libs package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A flaw was found in SQLite. When the Full Text Search (FTS5) extension is enabled and secure-delete mode is active, processing a database containing a corrupted search index triggers a heap-based buffer overflow. An attacker who tricks an application or user into opening a crafted database file can exploit this flaw to execute arbitrary code or cause a Denial of Service (DoS) by crashing the application."
              },
